# Health agent

Python 3.12, Google ADK. Consumes an `AnalysisPayload`, produces a `HealthRead`.

- The agent NEVER computes or modifies scores. Numbers come from `health/scoring`. The agent writes reasoning and recommendations around them.
- The agent NEVER runs analysis tools. It consumes CI output.
- Deterministic findings are authoritative. A failed architecture test is a fact.
- Runtime signals arrive with `illustrative: true`. Say so in the reasoning.
- Distinguish a genuine violation from an accepted trade-off. Duplication between services is deliberate.
- Type hints everywhere. pytest. Do not swallow errors; every run must be traceable.
